OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FA woman from Bowness-on-Windermere has
OL,7,Flaunched a petition against temporary
OL,8,Fcampsites, as one is set to open in
OL,9,Fthe field behind her back garden.
OL,11,FSarah Wilson says that a campsite of
OL,12,Fup to 50 pitches is opening on land by
OL,13,Fher house this week, and that "around
OL,14,F100 people" will have only one
OL,15,Flavatory between them on the site.
OL,17,FIn a Change.org petition, Ms Wilson
OL,18,Fsaid: "We are told nobody can stop it."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
