CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1786544309
OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FSince 2023, landowners have been able
OL,7,Fto establish pop-up campsites of up to
OL,8,F50 pitches with no planning
OL,9,Fpermission. Instead, an operator must
OL,10,Fmerely notify the planning authority,
OL,11,Fwhich has no easy ability to refuse
OL,12,Fpermission.
OL,14,FMs Wilson also said in her petition
OL,15,Fthat "The Lake District National Park
OL,16,FAuthority has confirmed to us in
OL,17,Fwriting that whatever it thinks of the
OL,18,Fimpacts, it cannot intervene".
OL,20,FWhat is allowed when establishing a
OL,21,Ftemporary campsite?
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,325,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1786544309
OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FUnder 'Class BC' rules, such a
OL,7,Frecreational campsite can be
OL,8,Festablished for up to 60 days, an
OL,9,Fincrease on the 28-day-limit
OL,10,Fpreviously in force.
OL,12,FIn 2023, the Government said that this
OL,13,Frule "will ensure that holidaymakers
OL,14,Fcan continue to visit and stay in
OL,15,Fpopular destinations around the
OL,16,Fcountry and provide a boost to local
OL,17,Feconomies and businesses".
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,325,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1786544309
OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FThe use of campervans and motorhomes
OL,7,Fis also permitted on these temporary
OL,8,Fpitches, but the use of a caravan
OL,9,Fwould require further planning
OL,10,Fpermission.
OL,12,FWhen notifying the planning authority
OL,13,Fof a temporary campsite, a site plan
OL,14,Fwith details of toilet and waste
OL,15,Ffacilities must be submitted, as well
OL,16,Fas the dates during which the campsite
OL,17,Fwill be in use.
OL,19,FIs there any way to block these
OL,20,Ftemporary sites?
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,325,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1786544309
OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FA local authority could revoke the
OL,7,Fplanning permission granted by central
OL,8,FGovernment for campsites, if there is
OL,9,Fenough evidence that a ban is
OL,10,Fnecessary to protect local amenity or
OL,11,Fthe wellbeing of an area.
OL,13,FThis is called an 'Article 4
OL,14,FDirection', and this has been
OL,15,Festablished in parts of Cornwall and
OL,16,Facross the New Forest National Park.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
