FL,325,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1786544309
OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FAndrew Smith, Head of Development
OL,7,FManagement at Lake District National
OL,8,FPark Authority, said: "We are aware of
OL,9,Fconcerns about several temporary
OL,10,Fcampsites across the National Park.
OL,12,F"We have also received multiple
OL,13,Frequests for an Article 4 Direction to
OL,14,Fbe served. We will be considering this
OL,15,Fissue further over the coming months."
OL,17,FMs Wilson says that the campsite near
OL,18,Fher home is inside the Windermere
OL,19,FVillas Conservation Area, which was
OL,20,Festablished earlier this year.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
