PN,32407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1786544309
OL,3,CLake District resident launches
OL,4,Cpetition against temporary camp sites
OL,6,FIn her petition she said: "If a 50-
OL,7,Fpitch campsite can appear beside
OL,8,Fpeople's homes here, with less
OL,9,Fscrutiny than a garden shed, the word
OL,10,F'protected' has lost its meaning."
OL,12,FITV Border has approached the owner of
OL,13,Fthe temporary campsite, and the
OL,14,FDepartment for Levelling Up, Housing &
OL,15,FCommunities for comment.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
